; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#ula-ula-flags)
; AVP: ULA-Flags
; Command: Update-Location-Answer
; Section: 5.2.1.1.1
; Table: 5.2.1.1.1/2
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"It shall be present only when the Result-Code AVP is DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#ula-subscription-data)
; AVP: Subscription-Data
; Command: Update-Location-Answer
; Section: 5.2.1.1.1
; Table: 5.2.1.1.1/2
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"It shall be present if success is reported, unless an explicit \"skip subscriber data\" indication was present in the request."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#ulr-sgsn-number)
; AVP: SGSN-Number
; Command: Update-Location-Request
; Section: 5.2.1.1.1
; Table: 5.2.1.1.1/1
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"It shall be present when the message is sent on the S6d interface and the SGSN supports LCS (using MAP based Lg interface) or SMS functionalities or the Gs interface."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#ulr-ue-srvcc-capability)
; AVP: UE-SRVCC-Capability
; Command: Update-Location-Request
; Section: 5.2.1.1.1
; Table: 5.2.1.1.1/1
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"shall be present if the MME or the SGSN supports SRVCC and this information is available to the MME or the SGSN."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#ulr-mme-number-for-mt-sms)
; AVP: MME-Number-for-MT-SMS
; Command: Update-Location-Request
; Section: 5.2.1.1.1
; Table: 5.2.1.1.1/1
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
