    requires DSR-Flags bit "Trace Data Withdrawal"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#dsr-context-identifier)
; AVP: Context-Identifier
; Command: Delete-Subscriber-Data-Request
; Application-ID: 16777251
; Section: 5.2.2.2.1
; Table: 5.2.2.2.1/1
; Page: 42
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"This element shall be present only if the \"PDN subscription contexts Withdrawal\" bit or the \"PDP context withdrawal\" bit is set in the DSR-Flags."
    requires DSR-Flags bit "PDN subscription contexts Withdrawal" or DSR-Flags bit "PDP contexts Withdrawal"
"In the \"PDN subscription contexts Withdrawal\" case, the Context-Identifier shall not be associated with the default APN configuration."
    text-only
"For the compatibility with the MAP protocol as defined in the TS 29.002 [24], this parameter shall not have a value of zero."
    exclude 0


