    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#nor-visited-network-identifier)
; AVP: Visited-Network-Identifier
; Command: Notify-Request
; Section: 5.2.5.1.1
; Table: 5.2.5.1.1/1
; Page: 53
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"It shall be present when the PDN GW Identity is present and does not contain an FQDN."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#nor-service-selection)
; AVP: Service-Selection
; Command: Notify-Request
; Section: 5.2.5.1.1
; Table: 5.2.5.1.1/1
; Page: 53
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"For establishment of non-emergency PDN connections, it shall be present if the selected PDN-GW is present and is particular for one specific APN and not common to all the APNs."
    text-only
"For establishment of emergency PDN connections (i.e., the Emergency-Services AVP is present, with the Emergency-Indication flag set), this AVP shall be left absent."
