"Inter-PLMN-inter-MME handover"              = 9
"Intra-PLMN-inter-MME handover"              = 10
"PDN Context Sync Up With UDM not requested" = 11


; Type: Value Table
; AVP: ULA-Flags
; Kind: bits
; Section: 7.3.8
