; Name: APN-Configuration-Profile
; Section: 7.3.34
; Page: 126
APN-Configuration-Profile ::= < AVP header: 1429 10415 >
        { Context-Identifier }
        [ Additional-Context-Identifier ]
        [ Third-Context-Identifier ]
        { All-APN-Configurations-Included-Indicator }
     1* { APN-Configuration }
      * [ AVP ]


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#apn-configuration-profile-default-context)
; AVP: Context-Identifier
; Within: APN-Configuration-Profile
; Section: 7.3.34
; Page: 126
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"The Context-Identifier AVP shall identify the per subscriber's default APN configuration."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#apn-configuration-profile-additional-context)
; AVP: Additional-Context-Identifier
; Within: APN-Configuration-Profile
; Section: 7.3.34
; Page: 126
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"If present, the Additional-Context-Identifier AVP shall identify another default APN configuration, only for those subscriptions containing more than one types of APNs"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.272.py#apn-configuration-profile-third-context)
; AVP: Third-Context-Identifier
; Within: APN-Configuration-Profile
; Section: 7.3.34
; Page: 126
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
